s see lower profits in asset management and corporate\par finance offset by higher banking profits. Looking for dividend news,\par expecting it to be flat at 9p.\par KGHM Polska Miedz (R.KGH): 4Q consolidated earnings\par Note: The Polish copper producer plans to post a net profit of 154\par million zloty for 2003, the daily Rzeczpospolita reported last week.\par The company also plans to spend over PLZ400 million on investment, the\par paper said. Meanwhile, it is also looking to consolidate its fixed-line\par telephone unit Telefonia Dialog with El-Net, the daily Puls Biznesu\par reports.\par Plastic Omnium (F.POM): FY Earnings\par Consensus net profit (Multex, 4 analysts): EUR27.7M (EUR18.5M)\par Forecast range: EUR23M - EUR31.3M\par Consensus sales: EUR1.63B (EUR1.57B)\par British Polythene Industries (U.BPO): FY earnings\par Consensus pretax profit (Multex, 3 analysts): GBP13.9M (GBP16.2M)\par Forecast range: GBP12.8M - GBP15.9M\par Consensus sales: GBP348.3M (GBP387M)\par Mersey Docks & Harbour (U.MDK): FY earnings\par Consensus pretax profit (Multex, 7 analysts): GBP54.4M (GBP55.6M)\par Forecast range: GBP53.2M - GBP55M\par Consensus sales: GBP275.6M (GBP262M)\par Amper (E.AMP): FY Earnings\par Consensus net profit (Multex, 3 analysts): EUR6.2M (N/A)\par Forecast range: EUR5M - EUR7.4M\par Consensus sales: EUR282.7M (EUR337M)\par Wembley (U.WMY): FY earnings\par Consensus pretax profit (Multex, 4 analysts): GBP34.3M (GBP33.6M)\par Forecast range: GBP26.3M - GBP37.2M\par Consensus sales: GBP120M (GBP138M)\par Sherwood International (U.SHC): FY earnings\par Consensus pretax profit (Multex, 6 analysts): GBP5.9M (GBP2.4M)\par Forecast range: GBP5.5M - GBP6.6M\par Consensus sales: GBP54.8M (GBP57M)\par Innogenetics (B.IGT): FY Earnings\par Consensus net loss (Multex, 2 analysts): EUR14.8M (EUR9.9M)\par Forecast range: EUR15.7M - EUR13.8M\par Consensus sales: EUR50.5M (EUR53M)\par Quayle Munro Holdings (U.QMH): 1H earnings\par Statpro Group (U.SOG): FY earnings\par