\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr Falls Fast Vs Yen Amid Suspicion BOJ Not  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2  By John Parry and Agnes T. Crane \par \uc2 513 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 20:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK -(Dow Jones)- The dollar slid rapidly against the yen early afternoon Monday, stoking suspicions that apparent support for the greenback from the Bank of Japan may have waned. \par \par \uc2  The greenback was already under pressure from worries about a potential war with Iraq against other major rivals. But it then tumbled swiftly through some technical support levels, diving to Y117.19 from around Y117.83. \par \par \uc2  The steep move against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped drive the dollar to new global session lows with the euro within spitting distance of the key $1.09 mark. \par \par \uc2  The drop of more than half a yen against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  happened within seconds, as the dollar fell below some areas where traders would have expected the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's drop met with little apparent resistance. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Japan - which acts on behalf of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  in such moves - undertook covert \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in order to weaken the yen last month amounting to some $4.5 billion. That had made traders nervous that the BOJ would once again defend some key levels between around Y117.60 and Y117.80. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in Monday's global session some traders said they suspected covert BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have been once again at work, serving to prop up the dollar against the yen throughout the New York morning. None had actually seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however. Any waning of such supportive efforts could have left the dollar vulnerable against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which helps to partly explain the swift slide in the New York afternoon. \par \par \uc2  Key stop loss levels were breached amid heavy selling  once traders realized the BOJ hadn't come in at the Y117.60 to the Y117.80 area as the market had speculated for much of the day's session, said Harrish Bajaj, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Investors Bank & Trust in Boston. \par \par \uc2  The whiplash of the dollar against the yen took place amid thinning trading conditions as the London day wound down, making it easier for traders to test the BOJ's resolve. \par \par \uc2  There was little fundamental political or economic news driving the dollar's fall, which has partially and abruptly retraced as a result. \par \par \uc2  By 1:50 p.m. EST, the greenback had regained some ground, to Y117.52, but was still clearly lower than its Y118.08 level late Friday in New York. The euro was at $1.0884, steeply up from $1.0797 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Against the Swiss franc, the dollar was at CHF1.3401, at levels where traders said earlier Monday they would be very nervous at the possibility the Swiss National Bank might be prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an effort to weaken its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Sterling was at $1.5767, up from $1.5730 late Friday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    By John Parry; Dow Jones Newswires\par    john.parry@dowjones.com; 201-938-2096\par    By Agnes T. Crane; Dow Jones Newswires\par    agnes.crane@dowjones.com; 201-938-2248\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030303dz3300795\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
