\par\par \b \uc2  IMM speculators grow net long yen position - CFTC. \b0\par\par\uc2 683 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Februar 2003\par 23:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Kyle Peterson\par     CHICAGO, Feb 28 (Reuters) - Speculators of IMM yen futures\par expanded a collective long position from Feb. 19 to Feb. 25 to\par its largest in three years, data released on Friday showed.\par     The data from the Commodity Futures Trading Commission's\par Commitments of Traders report on speculative positioning are\par used by analysts as a reverse indicator of future market\par direction. For example, extreme net long speculative positions\par often signal a decline in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , especially if that\par position conflicts with those held by the more influential\par commercial players.\par  \par     Speculators generally comprise trend followers seeking to\par pick a precise top or bottom in the market.\par     Speculators in IMM yen futures grew a net long position to\par 35,754 contracts, its largest since November 1999, compared\par with 18,433 contracts reported in the previous week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Analysts say the extremely large net long position puts the\par yen in position for a fast turnaround in sentiment if the more\par influential commercial community begins a selling spree.\par     "They're exactly the types to be turned around if there is a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sudden demand shock for dollars," said Andrew Delano, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par analyst at IDEAglobal, of the speculators. "And that would very\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par likely put wind at the back of any \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  effort to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par support the dollar."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Yen futures have enjoyed almost nonstop gains in February,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par despite periodic hints and confirmation that the Bank of Japan\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par has been in the market selling yen in an effort to stem further\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par gains for that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Japanese officials have complained that\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par an overly strong yen chokes the local export market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The BOJ revealed in a monthly report that it had sold 513\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par billion yen ($4.36 billion) in the month. The news bolstered the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par yen vs. the dollar, but analysts said the speculators remain\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par unconvinced that the yen is set for declines.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  seems to be speaking to deaf ears\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in the speculative community, because they are showing a great\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par deal of appetite to stay with the trend, which is a lower\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar/yen," Delano said. "It's a market that on one hand is\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ignoring the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  threat, and on the other is growing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par more vulnerable to it."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par During the CFTC's reporting period, March yen futures\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par vaulted from a close of $0.008435 on Feb. 19 to a close of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par $0.008538 on Feb. 25.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Data on other IMM contracts were less dramatic. Speculators\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in euro futures shrank a net long position to 20,063 contracts\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from 25,485 contracts in the previous week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Speculators in sterling futures posted a net short position\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of 910 contracts, reversing a net long position of 376 contracts\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par held in the previous week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "That would close the books on what had been a very sizable\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par long position within the context of this particular contract,"\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Delano said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    JAPANESE YEN (Contracts of 12,500,000 yen)\par              2/25/03 week         2/19/03 week\par    Long          45,047               37,746\par    Short          9,293               19,313\par    Net           35,754               18,433\par     EURO (Contracts of 125,000 euros)\par              2/25/03 week         2/19/03 week\par    Long          29,793               31,970\par    Short          9,730                6,485\par    Net           20,063               25,485\par     POUND STERLING (Contracts of 62,000 pounds sterling)\par              2/25/03 week         2/19/03 week\par    Long           3,807                6,298\par    Short          4,717                5,922\par    Net             -910                  376\par     SWISS FRANC (Contracts of 125,000 Swiss francs)\par              2/25/03 week         2/19/03 week\par    Long          18,644               17,243\par    Short          2,801                2,737\par    Net           15,843               14,506\par     CANADIAN DOLLAR (Contracts of 100,000 Canadian dollars)\par              2/25/03 week         2/19/03 week\par    Long          41,929               43,606\par    Short            320                  200\par    Net           41,609               43,406\par     AUSTRALIAN DOLLAR (Contracts of 100,000 Aussie dollars)\par              2/25/03 week         2/19/03 week\par    Long          18,461               18,514\par    Short            431                  431\par    Net           18,030               18,083\par     MEXICAN PESO (Contracts of 500,000 pesos)\par              2/25/03 week         2/19/03 week\par    Long             192                1,466\par    Short         20,724               17,043\par    Net          -20,532              -15,577.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030228dz2s013ny\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
