\par\par \b \uc2  Shiokawa denies  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , market awaits data. \b0\par\par\uc2 570 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Februar 2003\par 04:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Feb 28 (Reuters) - Japanese Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said on Friday he did not think \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market recently, but traders expect \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data later in the day to prove him wrong. \par \par \uc2  "I don't think they've done it yet," Shiokawa told a news conference when asked whether the government had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  lately in an attempt to reverse the yen's strength. \par \par \uc2  "But it is true there seems to be speculation that the government will... Our stance is that we must consider that if moves are rapid," Shiokawa said. \par \par \uc2  Shiokawa added that the government should watch the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for a while longer to decide if action was needed. \par \par \uc2  Japanese officials are concerned that a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could undermine exports, one of the few bright spots in the economy. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Japan figures to be released later on Friday are expected to confirm that Japanese authorities did indeed step in to stem the yen's rise this week. \par \par \uc2  The data cover the month through Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Under a new policy, officials have kept silent on whether or not they have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the yen, although market sources said the BOJ, acting for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , stepped into the market late on Wednesday to sell yen against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was quoted at 117.70/73 yen  at 0240 GMT compared with 117.62/70 yen in late U.S. trade but nearly a full yen above a nearly six-month low of 116.85 hit on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The yen has risen about four percent against the dollar since the start of the year as concerns about the U.S. economy and worries about war on Iraq have shaken faith in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The MOF said last month it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  from mid-January, buying some $6 billion in that month to curb the yen's rise. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was conducted covertly. Previously, the government quickly confirmed any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  KEEPING THE MARKET GUESSING \par \par \uc2  Traders believe the government is trying to keep the market on its toes by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  quietly and in smaller amounts. \par \par \uc2  The new approach also reflects the lack of long-term success of previous massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although officials have not ruled out major \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if required. \par \par \uc2  Vice Finance Minister Zembei Mizoguchi said on Friday that he could not comment on whether there had been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Sometimes the situation calls for us to clearly state our intentions, sometimes not," he said. \par \par \uc2  He added, however, that rapid fluctuations of the yen against the dollar and the euro were undesirable. \par \par \uc2  In parliament, Shiokawa sought to clarify the government's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  "The market decides rates, and artificial \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be avoided," he said when asked about his recent remarks on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Shiokawa has said on various occasions that the government should be wary of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But he has also said the government should act to counter any volatile moves and that the yen's fair value in terms of purchasing power parity (PPP) was around 150 to 160 yen to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "I just presented the figure to show that the yen was high in terms of PPP and... I did not mean to say we should force it to stay at 150 yen," he said. \par \par \uc2  PPP is a way to compare living costs of countries by looking at prices of similar items. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030228dz2s005pr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
