\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF hints at  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  against yen rise. \b0\par\par\uc2 482 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 2003\par 02:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Feb 26 (Reuters) - Japanese authorities kept up threats on Wednesday to act to stem the yen's gains, saying they were ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if necessary. \par \par \uc2  Top financial diplomat Zembei Mizoguchi said recent movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market had been rapid and inappropriate, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  was watching the market closely. \par \par \uc2  "Recents movements have been rapid. The yen has moved about four yen against the dollar in a week," Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "Such movements are inappropriate, and the ministry is closely watching against excessive movements," he added. \par \par \uc2  He declined to say if \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Japanese authorities quietly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market in mid-January, buying some $6 billion to stem the yen's rise. \par \par \uc2  Tokyo is especially concerned about the yen strengthening because of its effect on the profits of major companies ahead of book-closings at the end of Japan's financial year on March 31. \par \par \uc2  Separately, a senior MOF official said comments by Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates did not indicate any change in the ministry's stance. \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell on Tuesday after Shiokawa said finance ministers of the Group of Seven (G7) had agreed at a weekend meeting that exchange rates should be determined by the market. \par \par \uc2  The MOF official said the G7 was in agreement to cooperate if there were rapid fluctuations in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, which included concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Cooperation in this case could be concerted, as well as sole \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  G7 STATEMENT \par \par \uc2  A statement after the meeting of G7 finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors in Paris said: "We will continue to monitor exchange markets closely and cooperate as appropriate." \par \par \uc2  The Japanese official added that Shiokawa's comment arose from questions in parliament on whether the yen could be driven lower, and there was no change in the ministry's stance that \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  should reflect fundamentals and move stably. \par \par \uc2  "The minister's remarks meant that the yen could not be weakened in a way that would depart from economic fundamentals. It did not mean that rates would be left solely to financial markets," the official said. \par \par \uc2  Asked if Japanese authorities would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the yen's rise, the official said authorities would take action as appropriate while watching market conditions closely. \par \par \uc2  The yen backed off against the dollar in early Asian trading on Wednesday but the greenback was running out of steam as chances of war in Iraq undermined sentiment towards it. \par \par \uc2  By mid-morning the dollar was quoted at around 117.46 yen compared with 117.25/33 yen in late New York trade on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The euro was around $1.0750 against Tuesday's $1.0757/61. The single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was around 126.30 yen against 126.32/39. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030226dz2q003ea\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
