\par\par \b \uc2  Mizoguchi says  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  moves rapid, inappropriate. \b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 2003\par 01:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Feb 26 (Reuters) - Japan's top financial diplomat, Zembei Mizoguchi, said on Wednesday that recent movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market had been rapid and inappropriate, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  was watching the market closely. \par \par \uc2  "Recents movements have been rapid. The yen has moved about four yen against the dollar in a week," Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "Such movements are inappropriate, and the ministry is closely watching against excessive movements," he added. He declined to say if \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The yen backed off against the dollar in early Asian trading on Wednesday as the market pondered the chances of Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  following its rise to its highest levels in nearly six months. \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell on Tuesday after Japanese Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said G7 ministers meeting last weekend had agreed that \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates should be determined by the market. \par \par \uc2  In early dealings the dollar was around 117.45 yen  compared with 117.25/33 yen in late New York on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The euro was around $1.0748  against Tuesday's $1.0757/61. The single\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was around 126.25 yen            against 126.32/39.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030226dz2q001p6\par }\