\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar regains ground ahead of jobs data. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Natsuko Waki \par \uc2 562 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Februar 2003\par 12:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Feb 7 (Reuters) - The dollar regained ground against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday as expectations for favourable U.S. jobs data offered the market a temporary distraction from Washington's warnings that a war in Iraq might not be far off. \par \par \uc2  The January jobs report, due at 1330 GMT, is likely to show that 70,000 new jobs were created compared with a loss of 101,000 jobs in December. Strong jobs-related numbers on ISM business surveys raised expectations that the figures could be even better. But comments from U.S. President George W. Bush on Thursday that "the game is over" for Iraqi President Saddam Hussein hampered the dollar's substantial recovery given concerns about a costly U.S.-war and its damage on the greenback. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar saw a bit of recovery and major upward surprise on payrolls data will be positive for the dollar," said Osman Wahid, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at J.P. Morgan Chase. \par \par \uc2  "The U.S. data coming in have been more on the positive side but we are still seeing the remaining dollar weakness. A wave of uncertainties of a war has been a drag for the dollar and the market is still hugely driven by geopolitical concerns." \par \par \uc2  By 1040 GMT, the dollar had risen more than half a percent to $1.0743 per euro and stood at 1.3645 Swiss francs, off its four-year lows set this week. \par \par \uc2  It also gained a third of a percent against the yen to 102.20. The trade-weighted dollar index is back above the 100 level. \par \par \uc2  TIME UP? \par \par \uc2  Traders took in their stride Thursday's comments by Bush that he would welcome a new U.N. resolution authorising war on Iraq. He at the same time signalled the United States was ready to attack with or without U.N. backing. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. accuses Iraq of hiding weapons of mass destruction from U.N. inspectors, though Baghdad denies this. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there was little new in Bush's warnings, and the market therefore had a rare opportunity to focus on economic data. \par \par \uc2  "The employment components of the ISM numbers were both quite strong... The ISM institute itself did say it was pretty encouraged by the strength coming through on the employment side," said Aziz McMahon, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at ABN Amro. \par \par \uc2  OTHER TENSIONS \par \par \uc2  In Japan, the yen was hampered by a variety of factors, including wariness about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that it secretly stepped into the market late last month to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from strengthening. \par \par \uc2  Japan's Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa and the country's top financial diplomat Zembei Mizoguchi both reiterated they are closely watching the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and would take appropriate action as needed. \par \par \uc2  Mizoguchi declined to comment on market talk \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have engaged in yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Escalating tensions in North Korea were also souring sentiment. The United States said it was ready for any contingency after the communist state issued threats of pre-emptive attack and suggested it was poised to restart an atomic reactor central to its suspected drive for nuclear arms. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, Sweden's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Riksbank, left the key repo rate unchanged at 3.75 percent, but forecast a rise in inflation above its two-percent target this year due to volatile energy prices. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030207dz2700kdd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
